<title>USA: Cosmetic Center Inc FY shr loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Cosmetic Center Inc FY shr loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>SAVAGE, Md. 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ended September 27</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $1.11   profit	 $0.06</p>
